    "title": "MM-Calendar",
    "description": "MM-Calendar is the most popular and useful calendar app for Myanmar people. \r\nWhat is inside the app? \r\n- Both Myanmar to English and English to Myanmar Calendar\r\n- Add TODO notes, events and memories that you want to save.\r\n- Search and calculate the date English to Myanmar or Myanmar to English\r\n- 100+ years English and Myanmar calendar \r\n- Support both zawgyi and unicode Fonts rendering\r\n- Find out the details of Myanmar Calendar and Daily Traditional Astrological Information as well\r\n- View Myanmar Public Holidays & many social events about Myanmar.",
